        "text": "Exercises\n1.\nWhat\u2019s wrong with the variable My Variable ?\n2.\nWithout trying the code, what TypeName will this cmdlet return?\nNew-Variable -Name MyVariable -Value \"somestuff\"\nGet-Variable MyVariable | Get-Member\n3.\nHow can we change the view of the errors PowerShell shows us?\n4.\nWhat automatic variable can we use to clear the contents of an array or hashtable?\n5.\nHow might we compare two integers?\n6.\nWhat is the object type of MyVariable here?\n$MyVariable = ,1\n7.\nHow would we get each character in a string into an array?\n8.\nWhat\u2019s going to go wrong here, and why?\nWrite-Output 'My Name is $MyName'\n9.\nHow can we create an object of type OrderedDictionary ?",
